none by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1589\n* Let the embedded runtime keep a branch's source frozen as a reusable branch base by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1590\n* Bump version to 1.24.0 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1591\n\n## New Contributors\n* @adam-r-kowalski made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1538\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.23.7...v1.24.0","mentions_count":3}
